 """miner_2 2026-07-30 cycle 21: explore & validate NOVEL close-only factors.

Lessons from prior cycles:
  - The post-miner gate evaluates factors in a STRICT namespace:
      eval(expr, {'__builtins__':{}}, {'pd':pd, 'np':np, 'close':panel})
