**Current Effective Factors:** All 3 above, validated 2026-07-30, ranked by quality score (0.01251 / 0.00347 / 0.00281). Note: mom20_volproxy60 and range_pos_120d have pairwise library correlation >0.5 with older candidates (mom_10d_skip5, mom_120d_skip5) — flagged as provenance metadata for the post-Miner gate; final admission subject to deterministic recomputation of pairwise rho from real signal artifacts.

**Plans:** Next cycle — explore low-correlation complementary families (carry/term-structure signals across the 15-asset universe, macro-regime conditional factors using observation-only DXY/VIX/USDJPY) to diversify the ensemble away from the momentum/trend cluster; schedule 3-month re-validation of the current effective set to track drift.

