Ensemble method: quality-IC tilt (`q = |IC|*|ICIR|`, weight = q/sum(q), direction = sign(IC)); gates include pairwise |rho|<0.5, turnover vs 10d cadence, artifact availability.

**Universe:** 15-instrument cross-asset tradable panel (equity indices, SOX/NDX, XAU, COPPER, WTI, BTC, ETH, DXY-related FX, VIX as proxy), dates 2020-01-01..2026-07-29 (2398 rows, 15 cols).

**Market regime assessment (from ensemble JSON):**
- Sideways-to-bear, risk-off rotation (not uniform bear).
- High/intensifying risk: VIX 23.76 (+44.8%/30d; +4.70 on 07-28 single session).
- Vol regime elevated; correlation moderate (mean |20d corr| ~0.34) with high dispersion.
- Liquidity tightening (DXY flat, XAU down) – positioning de-risking, not flight-to-safety.

